        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click Me Harder</strong> is the ultimate anime girl clicker experience you didn’t know you needed — and probably shouldn’t admit to playing. Start with one lonely anime girl and a dream: to click her. Hard. For money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click earns cash. Upgrade your clicks, automate your earnings with idle anime assistants, and snowball your empire into a full-blown waifu industrial complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/43c2ba8b66932e76bc1081360c448bdf.poster.avif?t=1763505003\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/43c2ba8b66932e76bc1081360c448bdf.webm?t=1763505003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/1ac71efe7016cba1b1eec89538294fa2.avif?t=1763505003\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anime girls. Repeatedly. For profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch numbers get bigger than your love for anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a waifu workforce — Upgrade girls to get more money and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle income so you can “go outside” and still earn money (you won’t).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable moral decisions wrapped in cute packaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Items to collect and trade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige your way to a victory by optionally sacrificing score to the anime overlords for small gain increases!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just clicking. You’re ascending.<br>Wishlist now and prepare to say: <strong>“I can stop anytime I want.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoiler: you won’t. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/fef3cf9f6510d90668bd7747662e40a4.avif?t=1763505003\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong>:    <br>1. Q: Can I contribute?  <br>A: Yes, just join the discord! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Q: Is the point to farm score, money, or steam items? <br>A: Yes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Q: Is this a naughty game? <br>A: NO, Get your head out of the gutter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Q: Is this a NFT game? <br>A: NO, absolutely not, its a &quot;Steam Inventory Item&quot; farming game. Steam inventory items pre-date NFTs (came before), although &quot;NFT's&quot; may have copied a bit from steam items, they are not the same or similar. This game does not use any crypto/blockchain technology and only uses tools provided by Steam. This game doesn't harm your hardware, unlike crypto mining. Steam does not allow crypto/blockchain/NFT games. <br> <br>5. Q: Why did you use AI for this? <br>A: For programming, it should be obvious that AI is at a point where its nearly impossible to write code that is better AND do it at a rate faster than AI, we are only humans and AI is a good tool for programming.  <br>For artwork, this may have been a oversight, but finding artist that expect reasonable rates is harder than you might think. So I'm asking for any community member to join the discord, and comment in the community forums to help us make this game better!  <br> <br>6. Q: I left the game open for 5-10mins still no drops, did you scam me?! <br>A: NO, I took nothing from you first of all. Second of all, the steam drop system is partly developer controlled and partly steam controlled, so sometimes the drop trigger drops nothing, no one has an explanation for why.  <br>This game has a drop trigger every time you open it and every 15min after (unless you decrease it by buying buffs, which can lower it to a 5min loop), expecting items with only 10mins of game time may not work...... Have you thought of possibly opening the game again...? There might be something already waiting for you.... ;) <br>NOTE: Game time is part of my small algorithm, so if you don't get a drop right away, come back, try again, be more patient! </h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click Me Harder</strong> is the ultimate anime girl clicker experience you didn’t know you needed — and probably shouldn’t admit to playing. Start with one lonely anime girl and a dream: to click her. Hard. For money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click earns cash. Upgrade your clicks, automate your earnings with idle anime assistants, and snowball your empire into a full-blown waifu industrial complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/43c2ba8b66932e76bc1081360c448bdf.poster.avif?t=1763505003\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/43c2ba8b66932e76bc1081360c448bdf.webm?t=1763505003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/1ac71efe7016cba1b1eec89538294fa2.avif?t=1763505003\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anime girls. Repeatedly. For profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch numbers get bigger than your love for anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a waifu workforce — Upgrade girls to get more money and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle income so you can “go outside” and still earn money (you won’t).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable moral decisions wrapped in cute packaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Items to collect and trade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige your way to a victory by optionally sacrificing score to the anime overlords for small gain increases!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just clicking. You’re ascending.<br>Wishlist now and prepare to say: <strong>“I can stop anytime I want.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoiler: you won’t. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/fef3cf9f6510d90668bd7747662e40a4.avif?t=1763505003\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong>:    <br>1. Q: Can I contribute?  <br>A: Yes, just join the discord! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Q: Is the point to farm score, money, or steam items? <br>A: Yes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Q: Is this a naughty game? <br>A: NO, Get your head out of the gutter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Q: Is this a NFT game? <br>A: NO, absolutely not, its a &quot;Steam Inventory Item&quot; farming game. Steam inventory items pre-date NFTs (came before), although &quot;NFT's&quot; may have copied a bit from steam items, they are not the same or similar. This game does not use any crypto/blockchain technology and only uses tools provided by Steam. This game doesn't harm your hardware, unlike crypto mining. Steam does not allow crypto/blockchain/NFT games. <br> <br>5. Q: Why did you use AI for this? <br>A: For programming, it should be obvious that AI is at a point where its nearly impossible to write code that is better AND do it at a rate faster than AI, we are only humans and AI is a good tool for programming.  <br>For artwork, this may have been a oversight, but finding artist that expect reasonable rates is harder than you might think. So I'm asking for any community member to join the discord, and comment in the community forums to help us make this game better!  <br> <br>6. Q: I left the game open for 5-10mins still no drops, did you scam me?! <br>A: NO, I took nothing from you first of all. Second of all, the steam drop system is partly developer controlled and partly steam controlled, so sometimes the drop trigger drops nothing, no one has an explanation for why.  <br>This game has a drop trigger every time you open it and every 15min after (unless you decrease it by buying buffs, which can lower it to a 5min loop), expecting items with only 10mins of game time may not work...... Have you thought of possibly opening the game again...? There might be something already waiting for you.... ;) <br>NOTE: Game time is part of my small algorithm, so if you don't get a drop right away, come back, try again, be more patient! </h2>",
